   "text": "A deadline timer can point at a deal, a project, a\ntask or a release, so it is not tied to one table. A\nQA report outlives the release it tested.",
   "originalText": "A deadline timer can point at a deal, a project, a\ntask or a release, so it is not tied to one table. A\nQA report outlives the release it tested.",
