   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Anyone with the link can read and change everything. The only gate is the\nhosting provider's password screen. This was a deliberate decision, not an\noversight.",
   "originalText": "Anyone with the link can read and change everything. The only gate is the\nhosting provider's password screen. This was a deliberate decision, not an\noversight.",
